codemap 8
path io-layout
kind layer
author ai
group gui
note The io-layout crate: the user's saved panel layout, one indented text file per user. LayoutStore::find picks the file: CODEMAP_LAYOUT when set, else $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/codemap/layout, ~/.config/codemap/layout or %APPDATA%\\codemap\\layout; a script or screenshot run asks with Reach::OverrideOnly, so only CODEMAP_LAYOUT reaches it and goldens never read a user's layout. load gives None for a missing, unreadable or malformed file, and the GUI then starts from its default tree; save creates the folder and writes through io-store. The value is domain's LayoutTree, which knows view names only as ViewKeys; the GUI maps them to its View enum and drops names it does not know.

